1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,634
A new kitchen for the Hartmans. Every kitchen starts as a job: click New job.

2
00:00:07,634 --> 00:00:20,518
Job number, job name and the customer.

3
00:00:20,518 --> 00:00:31,543
Write the plan in the notes: sink centred, drawers both sides, pantries at the end.

4
00:00:31,543 --> 00:00:35,401
Before adding cabinets, set up the room. Open the Room tab.

5
00:00:35,401 --> 00:00:40,103
The tape says the sink wall is 171" (14′ 3″). Type it as the room width.

6
00:00:40,103 --> 00:00:48,339
The room is 144" deep, and the ceiling is 96" (8 ft).

7
00:00:48,339 --> 00:00:52,281
The room is empty for now. Next: base cabinets from the library presets.
